{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.160.45.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d16af7d5a1cad904bdc33c4c10b2911","RawContent":"I am also planning a June 2016 Montego Bay wedding! Were looking into Rose Hall Suites for June 25 :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1885859,"PostDate":1423588271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am also planning a June 2016 Montego Bay wedding! Were looking into Rose Hall Suites for June 25 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinfarrell89@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"73.160.45.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423588105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kristin18","Id":282068,"Name":"Kristin18","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.1.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"149eddac24e3bfdf2087cf13ff63ee25","RawContent":"@[member=\"Kristin\"] do you know if the iberostar resorts allow entry to each location. For instance if we stayed at the grand rose and had the ceremony at the rose hall suites?","Attachments":[],"Id":1885865,"PostDate":1423588824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"208720\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/208720-kristin\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kristin<\/span><\/a> do you know if the iberostar resorts allow entry to each location. For instance if we stayed at the grand rose and had the ceremony at the rose hall suites?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmf0408@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.64.217","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423576366,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cablelove11","Id":282063,"Name":"Cablelove11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.78.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1423623661,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4daf24f1f127fc6e55f21128274eeed5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Kristin18\"] and @[member=\"Cablelove11\"] I&#039;m getting married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suites this June! 4 months from tomorrow, to be exact. If you stay at the Grand you have full access to the Suites and Beach. Suites you have full access to Beach. Beach is only Beach. But the Grand is adults-only if that makes a difference. We have a few kids coming, so Suites it is!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For a wedding, the same would apply unless there was already a wedding at that resort on that day. So if you&#039;re staying at the Grand you can&#039;t have your wedding at the Suites if a couple staying at the Suites was having their wedding that day. They would get first pick. They only do 1 wedding at each resort per day, which is a good thing!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Honestly, I have not seen one bride who hasn&#039;t been thrilled with her wedding at any of these three resorts. The wedding coordinators are all over it and they seem to do an amazing job and take care of everything! Plus, I like that the resort is near the airport for our guests and it isn&#039;t a HUGE resort where you need to be shuttled to get around.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you have other questions let me know!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885987,"PostDate":1423623637,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282068\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282068-kristin18\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kristin18<\/span><\/a> and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282063\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282063-cablelove11\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Cablelove11<\/span><\/a> I'm getting married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suites this June! 4 months from tomorrow, to be exact. If you stay at the Grand you have full access to the Suites and Beach. Suites you have full access to Beach. Beach is only Beach. But the Grand is adults-only if that makes a difference. We have a few kids coming, so Suites it is!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For a wedding, the same would apply unless there was already a wedding at that resort on that day. So if you're staying at the Grand you can't have your wedding at the Suites if a couple staying at the Suites was having their wedding that day. They would get first pick. They only do 1 wedding at each resort per day, which is a good thing!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Honestly, I have not seen one bride who hasn't been thrilled with her wedding at any of these three resorts. The wedding coordinators are all over it and they seem to do an amazing job and take care of everything! Plus, I like that the resort is near the airport for our guests and it isn't a HUGE resort where you need to be shuttled to get around.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have other questions let me know!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.5.149","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83dacfc02a16da00bf51a1efc5c9d867","RawContent":"Thank you @[member=\"beckys98\"] I think that more than covered my question!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1886014,"PostDate":1423659693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> I think that more than covered my question!!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmf0408@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.64.217","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423576366,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cablelove11","Id":282063,"Name":"Cablelove11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb4f2e9479025c79852737468dd285b7","RawContent":"I&#039;d stay away from any dates in Jamaica after may since you&#039;re getting into stormy season!! I&#039;m getting married at the Riu Montego Bay in Jamaica May 6th,2015 so if you need any help let me know!! @[member=\"Breena\"]\n\n\nThe plaza gazebo at this resort is amazing and VERY private IE you don&#039;t have random swimmers or tanners in any pics LOL! \n\n\n\n\nGood luck!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1890970,"PostDate":1427428902,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'd stay away from any dates in Jamaica after may since you're getting into stormy season!! I'm getting married at the Riu Montego Bay in Jamaica May 6th,2015 so if you need any help let me know!! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280962\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280962-breena\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Breena<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nThe plaza gazebo at this resort is amazing and VERY private IE you don't have random swimmers or tanners in any pics LOL! <br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1890970]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-282430-142742888014.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427428878.515018.jpg -  224.03KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2015\/post-282430-142742888014.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427428878.515018.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nGood luck!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426462378,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.160.15","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43a02f6ab4195a826ee9cdbfae82e025","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Looks beautiful!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks @[member=\"IzzyDeee\"] !&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I should make my final decision between Riu and Royalton white sands by the end of next week.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But I look forward to hear from your wedding experience. I am sure it will be magical.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891002,"PostDate":1427469546,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Looks beautiful!<\/p>\n<p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282430\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282430-izzydeee\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">IzzyDeee<\/span><\/a> !<\/p>\n<p>I should make my final decision between Riu and Royalton white sands by the end of next week.<\/p>\n<p>But I look forward to hear from your wedding experience. I am sure it will be magical.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrina_cajuste@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.145.50.207","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414938518,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280962.jpg?_r=1442323810","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":53,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Breena","Id":280962,"Name":"Breena","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7be627ce4a20a0a4768205def0f087a9","RawContent":"Anytime! I&#039;ve been to Jamaica twice before and absolutely love it!! Can&#039;t believe we leave in 35 days!! [emoji4] @[member=\"Breena\"]\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891004,"PostDate":1427469751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Anytime! I've been to Jamaica twice before and absolutely love it!! Can't believe we leave in 35 days!! [emoji4] @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280962\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn nam