{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d20414d243452c22828cf08d6b782a07","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Breena\" post=\"1891002\" timestamp=\"1427469546\"]\nLooks beautiful!\nThanks @[member=\"IzzyDeee\"] !\nI should make my final decision between Riu and Royalton white sands by the end of next week.\nBut I look forward to hear from your wedding experience. I am sure it will be magical.[\/quote]\nWe are also getting married at the Royalton. When are you looking to book? I can recommend our travel agent to anyone interested. She is amazing! She has gone above and beyond for my Fiance and I. She is actually from Jamaica and specializes in Jamaica weddings.","Attachments":[],"Id":1893742,"PostDate":1429560157,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Breena, on 27 March 2015 - 07:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Looks beautiful!<\/p>\n<p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282430\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282430-izzydeee\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">IzzyDeee<\/span><\/a> !<\/p>\n<p>I should make my final decision between Riu and Royalton white sands by the end of next week.<\/p>\n<p>But I look forward to hear from your wedding experience. I am sure it will be magical.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are also getting married at the Royalton. When are you looking to book? I can recommend our travel agent to anyone interested. She is amazing! She has gone above and beyond for my Fiance\u00a0and I. She is actually from Jamaica and specializes in Jamaica weddings.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.164.79.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cd0363b1dc89d66760f1261fb207d12","RawContent":"I Lisa ! I booked RWS for June 4, 16. I cannot wait! I do have an amazing travel agent but thank you for the offer\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1894298,"PostDate":1429912654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I Lisa ! I booked RWS for June 4, 16. I cannot wait! I do have an amazing travel agent but thank you for the offer<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrina_cajuste@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.145.50.207","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414938518,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280962.jpg?_r=1442323810","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":53,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Breena","Id":280962,"Name":"Breena","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3261932e75ebb30e961ee67a94dbdb94","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Breena\" post=\"1894298\" timestamp=\"1429912654\"]\nI Lisa ! I booked RWS for June 4, 16. I cannot wait! I do have an amazing travel agent but thank you for the offer\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nJust saw this now! That&#039;s amazing! I am so happy with the Royalton this far. I have heard nothing but great things.","Attachments":[],"Id":1894562,"PostDate":1430153525,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Breena, on 24 April 2015 - 01:57 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I Lisa ! I booked RWS for June 4, 16. I cannot wait! I do have an amazing travel agent but thank you for the offer<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just saw this now! That's amazing! I am so happy with the Royalton this far. I have heard nothing but great things.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.132.9.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"373e85cdca30c5623427e73a792ec0ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Breena!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement and good luck planning.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m a newbie, planning for my wedding in Ocho Rios in June 2016.&amp;nbsp; I decided to go with the newly renovated Moon Palace.&amp;nbsp; RWS had been suggested to us, but decided to go with MPJG.&amp;nbsp; We&#039;ve been to MoBay and wanted to do somewhere else closer to tours.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m excited as I know you are...good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904797,"PostDate":1442336193,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Breena!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on your engagement and good luck planning.\u00a0 I'm a newbie, planning for my wedding in Ocho Rios in June 2016.\u00a0 I decided to go with the newly renovated Moon Palace.\u00a0 RWS had been suggested to us, but decided to go with MPJG.\u00a0 We've been to MoBay and wanted to do somewhere else closer to tours.\u00a0 I'm excited as I know you are...good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">STBMrsPowell <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span>","Email":"shay_tt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"152.132.9.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438782799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284292.jpg?_r=1442327838","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"STBMrsPowell","Id":284292,"Name":"STBMrsPowell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"43.246.223.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3eae4812f099d590fb2f9ce5e9a765fb","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Hello Everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;I am so happy to have found this forum.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904871,"PostDate":1442427800,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Hello Everyone!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">I am so happy to have found this forum.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.eindiangirlsindubai.com\/2015\/08\/indian-escort-in-dubai.html'>Indian Escort in Dubai<\/a>","Email":"nisharajpoot007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"43.246.223.63","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442424289,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nisharajpoot","Id":284840,"Name":"nisharajpoot","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"152.132.9.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13177e6075ef549bca870edf430c5e56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@1weddinggirl&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Actually, I didn&#039;t have any problem reserving my date.&amp;nbsp; The one thing I can suggest is try to find a wedding specialist that can book your flights included in the package deal.&amp;nbsp; I have noticed that a lot of my guests were turned off from the package because they could find cheaper deals that included flights through other travel agencies.&amp;nbsp; Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905526,"PostDate":1443449150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@1weddinggirl<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Actually, I didn't have any problem reserving my date.\u00a0 The one thing I can suggest is try to find a wedding specialist that can book your flights included in the package deal.\u00a0 I have noticed that a lot of my guests were turned off from the package because they could find cheaper deals that included flights through other travel agencies.\u00a0 Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">STBMrsPowell <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span>","Email":"shay_tt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"152.132.9.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438782799,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284292.jpg?_r=1442327838","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"STBMrsPowell","Id":284292,"Name":"STBMrsPowell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.196.249.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6afde2778ad0165b2b658d829fea601c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Checking in to see if there are any new 2016 brides out here. It seems like there has not been a new post in about a month so thought I&#039;d try to reinvigorate the conversation.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married at Iberostar Suites in Montego Bay in August 2016 and just decided on a travel agent. So now I feel like all the planning is really starting for us. WOndering what some other brides are workign on (or stressing about) as we prepare to finish out 2015 and move into the big year... :wub:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906901,"PostDate":1446040816,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Checking in to see if there are any new 2016 brides out here. It seems like there has not been a new post in about a month so thought I'd try to reinvigorate the conversation.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married at Iberostar Suites in Montego Bay in August 2016 and just decided on a travel agent. So now I feel like all the planning is really starting for us. WOndering what some other brides are workign on (or stressing about) as we prepare to finish out 2015 and move into the big year... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eden.hurd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.196.249.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427751234,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Moni240","Id":282584,"Name":"Moni240","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.30.154.227","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ff7813d0498035437e6564ce6b3f660","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Moni240, I&#039;m new to this website. Just got engaged in October 2014 and am looking into getting married at Iberostar Suites in Montego Bay September 2016. I&#039;m torn because I want a place that includes really nice weddings so I can then just add onto my package but it seems like you have to pay for every single thing at Iberostar? Has anyone had their wedding at the Hyatt or Royalton Sands or even Beaches in Negril? Any advice anyone had to offer would be a great help!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907108,"PostDate":1446608454,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Moni240, I'm new to this website. Just got engaged in October 2014 and am looking into getting married at Iberostar Suites in Montego Bay September 2016. I'm torn because I want a place that includes really nice weddings so I can then just add onto my package but it seems like you have to pay for every single thing at Iberostar? Has anyone had their wedding at the Hyatt or Royalton Sands or even Beaches in Negril? Any advice anyone had to offer would be a great help!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"qhe19@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"73.30.154.227","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446593615,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"qhe19","Id":285237,"Name":"qhe19","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1446660550,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bec3c876982e0ab760c9960b78dbe51f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are getting married&amp;nbsp;at the Royalton in May.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907147,"PostDate":1446660540,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are getting married\u00a0at the Royalton in May.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.76.200","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78332,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89bc6a0a99a1c630424d586a511e347a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"qhe19\" post=\"1907108\" timestamp=\"1446608454\"]\nHi Moni240, I&#039;m new to this website. Just got engaged in October 2014 and am looking into getting married at Iberostar Suites in Montego Bay September 2016. I&#039;m torn because I want a place that includes really nice weddings so I can then just add onto my package but it seems like you have to pay for every single thing at Iberostar? Has anyone had their wedding at the Hyatt or Royalton Sands or even Beaches in Negril? Any advice anyone had to offer would be a great help![\/quote]Congratulations qhe19. We chose the Iberostar Suites because it is a nice hotel but also offered a more affordable let option at the Beach or adults-only option at the Grand. It also seemed like the basics were covered in their paid packages and you were able to manage other activities (ie. Semi-private dinner, informal welcome reception and cocktail hour) for free with a little \"creativity\". Hope you find a location that you love. Keep is posted as to what you decide. \n\nSent from my SM-G900V using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1907170,"PostDate":1446735431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>qhe19, on 03 November 2015 - 07:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi Moni240, I'm new to this website. Just got engaged in October 2014 and am looking into getting married at Iberostar Suites in Montego Bay September 2016. I'm torn because I want a place that includes really nice weddings so I can then just add onto my package but it seems like you have to pay for every single thing at Iberostar? Has anyone had their wedding at the Hyatt or Royalton Sands or even Beaches in Negril? Any advice anyone had to offer would be a great help!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nCongratulations qhe19. We chose the Iberostar Suites because it is a nice hotel but also offered a more affordable let option at the Beach or adults-only option at the Grand. It also seemed like the basics were covered in their paid packages and you were able to manage other activities (ie. Semi-private dinner, informal welcome reception and cocktail hour) for free with a little \"creativity\". Hope you find a location that you love. Keep is posted as to what you decide. <br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900V using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eden.hurd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.196.249.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427751234,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Moni240","Id":282584,"Name":"Moni240","IsOnline":true}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":42,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
