ece<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span face=\"\">Canopy Arrangement above the Pergola $400<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><strong>FLOWERS <\/strong>(prices plus 11% tax)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Tropical Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet Selection $80<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Luxury Bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $125<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Premium Bouquet Selection $350<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: blue\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Now Jade Premium Bouquet Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762684\/width\/600\/height\/529\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Bridesmaid\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s Bouquet $65<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Corsages (wrist or shoulder) $35<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Now Jade Corsage Options.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/762696\/width\/600\/height\/523\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.25pt\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 12px\">Premium Corsages $55<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left: 2.2