och8\/fiesta_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And in the middle have a photo holder similar to this (I am in the middle of making them) hold up our table names (events from when we have been together such as: graduation, engagement, trips, College Days, Love at first site) and pictures of those times. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/bird-holder.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Finally there will be tea lights all around that. I have an image in my head I hope it all comes out right!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Where did you order the maracas from?? That&#039;s such a great idea!","Attachments":[],"Id":941797,"PostDate":1259358627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>alkoch<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Well I don't have pics yet but here is my idea: <br \/> <br \/> Have the Mexican blanket\/serape as a table runner:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/images.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I ordered these maracas and I am going to put a pair or two on each table tied together by raffia.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/fiesta_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And in the middle have a photo holder similar to this (I am in the middle of making them) hold up our table names (events from when we have been together such as: graduation, engagement, trips, College Days, Love at first site) and pictures of those times. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/bird-holder.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Finally there will be tea lights all around that. I have an image in my head I hope it all comes out right!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Where did you order the maracas from?? That's such a great idea!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"italigirl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1258671619,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223404.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"italigirl","Id":223404,"Name":"italigirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":154,"TotalPages":16,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":150},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
